  "releaseNotes": "Host publishes and SDK image builds of one project are now serialized across processes, not only within one: a machine-wide lock backs the per-project gate, closing the WorkerExtensions build race a multi-targeted test suite hits when its frameworks run as parallel processes. Builds also run without the shared Roslyn compiler server, whose lingering reference handles could block the next publish of the same Function App.",
